# AG-3 Automated Backup and Backup Check

## Overview

APP01 was configured to automatically back up the Nextcloud system to the MinIO backup server using Restic.

The backup script is:

```bash
/usr/local/sbin/nextcloud-backup.sh
```

The script:
- creates a fresh MariaDB database dump
- backs up Nextcloud data using Restic
- sends the backup to MinIO
- records whether the backup was successful or failed

## Automatic Backup Schedule

A systemd timer was created to run the backup every 4 hours.

```text
00:00
04:00
08:00
12:00
16:00
20:00
```

The timer can be checked using:

```bash
sudo systemctl status nextcloud-backup.timer --no-pager
```

and:

```bash
systemctl list-timers nextcloud-backup.timer
```

## Backup Destination

